** Virtual versus in-person sessions

*** Add a one-time command that polls members for their global virtual versus
  in-person preference.
*** State up front whether each round is eligible for in-person only, virtual
  only, or either format.
*** Determine how often rounds are in-person-only versus either-format using the
  ratio of members who prefer virtual sessions.
*** For a round eligible for either format, allow members to select an optional
  per-round virtual/in-person preference.
**** If no per-round preference is selected, use the member's global preference.
**** Show that prompt only when the round is eligible for either format.
*** If at least one virtual-preferring attendee is available in the selected slot
  (using their per-round preference when given, otherwise their global
  preference), make the selected session virtual.

